# #3580: the plugin-builder stage COPYs teamspeak-plugin/ straight from
# the repo (it used to COPY a staged copy that image/build.sh had already
# stripped by hand). These are the same exclusions build.sh used to apply:
# node_modules is rebuilt in the stage against the gateway image's own npm,
# and the standalone-only scaffolding (SDK stubs, the standalone vitest
# config) exists for testing the plugin outside a gateway and would shadow
# the real SDK in a runtime install.
teamspeak-plugin/node_modules
teamspeak-plugin/test/sdk-stubs
teamspeak-plugin/vitest.standalone.config.ts

sexton/target
target
*.log
